WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
Now, here in this room

2
00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:04.840 line:15%
what we wanted to do was give you an idea

3
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.610 line:15%
of how to execute a Mid-century Modern,

4
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:13.610 line:15%
and I'm gonna go with home office because it's 2021.

5
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.280
I actually started with the chair.

6
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.050
That was my inspiration.

7
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.530
Work from the chair.

8
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.770
I love this pop of color.

9
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:26.770 line:15%
This red chair is from overstock.com and I love the shape.

10
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:31.890 line:15%
And let's get honest for a second about a desk chair.

11
00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.340
It must be comfortable.

12
00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.750
But this is really great on your arms, as well as a back.

13
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:41.500
You can sit in it honestly for hours like we're stuck doing.

14
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.360
And then don't forget to get up

15
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.090 line:15%
out of it and stretch every once in a while.

16
00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.000 line:15%
So for me, this was my beginning focal point.

17
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.200 line:15%
And then I built around from there.

18
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.320
I love this lamp.

19
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.980
I found it at Home Depot.

20
00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:59.010
This art I think is really true of a mid-century style

21
00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:01.660
which is to break up a single piece of art

22
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.080
into two pieces and separate it.

23
00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.730
It's very innovative.

24
00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:09.180 line:15%
It's got this cool edgy black

25
00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.080 line:15%
sort of painterly, swatches

26
00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.180 line:15%
and swipes in the middle, connecting it.

27
00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.033 line:15%
And I found those at Crate and Barrel.

28
00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:23.240 line:15%
Speaking of Crate and Barrel, I also found this globe.

29
00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.190 line:15%
I am a big globe collector.

30
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:29.510 line:15%
I actually probably have about 50 globes at my house.

31
00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:33.200 line:15%
There's some things that not only I love decoratively,

32
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.590
but in this modern age, I love to tell my children

33
00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:40.630
when we used to travel, where we're going on the globe.

34
00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:42.970
It's educational and it's soulful.

35
00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:45.430 line:15%
Now this rug, I love it's from Ikea

36
00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:49.170 line:15%
and the circular pattern in it to me hearkens back,

37
00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.860 line:15%
definitely to mid-century.

38
00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:56.150
So a lot of ways that you can execute

39
00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.660
a very pointed design style

40
00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:02.100
is available on modern websites everywhere.

41
00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.780
It's just about having references,

42
00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:05.960
building a mood board,

43
00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.510
and then building it thoughtfully piece by piece.

44
00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.310
Maybe don't go to one vendor for everything,

45
00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.470
that also is really helpful in design,

46
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:14.860
no matter what you're doing.

47
00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.180
When it comes to design, you want to remember the journey

48
00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.370
of how and where you found that.

49
00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:23.990
And that will, as Marie Kondo says, "Spark joy."

50
00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:26.230
And VFFs we wanted to help you add

51
00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.760
some mid-century style to your homes.

52
00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.040
So each of you are getting

53
00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.740
a $100 gift card from Costa Farms.

54
00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:33.573
(audience cheers)

55
00:02:33.573 --> 00:02:37.880
So that you can go buy a plant like we have here.

56
00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.030 line:15%
Because there's one thing I will say

57
00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:42.350 line:15%
about bringing the outside in,

58
00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:45.700 line:15%
I don't care what decade, our time period you're in

59
00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:49.239
that is really timeless to have nature in your space.

60
00:02:49.239 --> 00:02:51.822 line:15%
(upbeat music)

